{"schema_version": "examocrbench_task2_demo_gt_v1", "sample_id": "demo_task2_001", "coordinate_system": "normalized_1000", "elements": [{"element_id": "gt_0000", "element_type": "Page", "parent_id": null, "reading_order": 0, "bbox": [0, 0, 1000, 1000], "text": null, "content_format": "none"}, {"element_id": "gt_0001", "element_type": "Section", "parent_id": "gt_0000", "reading_order": 1, "bbox": [134.5367, 21.9046, 900.6995, 164.1652], "text": null, "content_format": "none"}, {"element_id": "gt_0002", "element_type": "Question", "parent_id": "gt_0001", "reading_order": 2, "bbox": [140.1701, 22.5239, 464.9031, 57.208], "text": "1.给选文加点的字注音。(2分)", "content_format": "plain_text"}, {"element_id": "gt_0003", "element_type": "ResponseSlot", "parent_id": "gt_0002", "reading_order": 3, "bbox": [471.8826, 24.7471, 898.298, 54.3181], "text": null, "content_format": "none"}, {"element_id": "gt_0004", "element_type": "Question", "parent_id": "gt_0001", "reading_order": 4, "bbox": [141.5325, 50.1077, 639.0205, 90.7683], "text": "2.在文中括号内正确的字下面画“$ \\underline{\\hspace{2cm}} $“ 。(2分)", "content_format": "mixed_latex"}, {"element_id": "gt_0005", "element_type": "Question", "parent_id": "gt_0001", "reading_order": 5, "bbox": [136.901, 83.7249, 894.9059, 159.9011], "text": "3. 第一段描写的是$ \\underline{\\hspace{2cm}} $ 时日出的景象，第二段描写的是$ \\underline{\\hspace{2cm}} $ 时日出的景象。（4分）", "content_format": "mixed_latex"}, {"element_id": "gt_0006", "element_type": "ResponseSlot", "parent_id": "gt_0005", "reading_order": 6, "bbox": [320.0969, 87.9144, 406.7081, 119.2786], "text": null, "content_format": "none"}, {"element_id": "gt_0007", "element_type": "ResponseSlot", "parent_id": "gt_0005", "reading_order": 7, "bbox": [755.3617, 76.3675, 858.2256, 112.634], "text": null, "content_format": "none"}, {"element_id": "gt_0008", "element_type": "Section", "parent_id": "gt_0000", "reading_order": 8, "bbox": [120.5431, 159.944, 936.7242, 839.7618], "text": null, "content_format": "none"}, {"element_id": "gt_0009", "element_type": "Instruction", "parent_id": "gt_0008", "reading_order": 9, "bbox": [125.4121, 165.2371, 922.5926, 641.2735], "text": "（二）课外阅读。（11分） 迷人的海滨夏夜 这是一个迷人的海滨的夏夜。 夕阳西下，天空燃烧着一片橘红色的晚霞。大海也被霞光染成了红色，它比天空的景色更壮观。当一排排波浪涌起的时候，那映照在浪峰上的霞光，又红又亮，闪烁着，滚动着，使人赞叹不已。 夜幕降临，天空的霞光渐渐淡下去了，深红的颜色变成了浅红，当一切红光都消失了的时候，那高而远的天空中便出现了启明星。它是那么大，那么亮，放射出令人注目的光辉，活像$ \\underline{ } $。 夜色渐浓，各处的灯火，也陆续亮了起来，尤其是山坡上那一片灯光，从半空中倒映在乌蓝的海面上，像$ \\underline{ } $。 我踏着软绵绵的沙滩，望着这夏夜的景色，心里有说不出的愉快和兴奋。", "content_format": "mixed_latex"}, {"element_id": "gt_0010", "element_type": "Question", "parent_id": "gt_0008", "reading_order": 10, "bbox": [140.2866, 645.1648, 744.4617, 674.643], "text": "1.在短文第三、四段的横线上把比喻句补充完整。 (4分)", "content_format": "plain_text"}, {"element_id": "gt_0011", "element_type": "ResponseSlot", "parent_id": "gt_0010", "reading_order": 11, "bbox": [519.2915, 449.2758, 761.9659, 480.7094], "text": null, "content_format": "none"}, {"element_id": "gt_0012", "element_type": "ResponseSlot", "parent_id": "gt_0010", "reading_order": 12, "bbox": [494.8666, 529.5569, 686.1302, 555.3826], "text": null, "content_format": "none"}, {"element_id": "gt_0013", "element_type": "Question", "parent_id": "gt_0008", "reading_order": 13, "bbox": [138.0865, 681.1514, 926.0535, 750.6852], "text": "2.这篇短文是按照$ \\underline{\\hspace{2cm}} $ 顺序写的，表示这个顺序的词有$ \\underline{\\hspace{2cm}} $ 、$ \\underline{\\hspace{2cm}} $ 、$ \\underline{\\hspace{2cm}} $ 。（4分）", "content_format": "mixed_latex"}, {"element_id": "gt_0014", "element_type": "ResponseSlot", "parent_id": "gt_0013", "reading_order": 14, "bbox": [346.3828, 685.8282, 409.8844, 711.2792], "text": null, "content_format": "none"}, {"element_id": "gt_0015", "element_type": "ResponseSlot", "parent_id": "gt_0013", "reading_order": 15, "bbox": [811.0688, 675.8853, 890.3919, 703.6042], "text": null, "content_format": "none"}, {"element_id": "gt_0016", "element_type": "ResponseSlot", "parent_id": "gt_0013", "reading_order": 16, "bbox": [152.3093, 720.1955, 259.6027, 753.0702], "text": null, "content_format": "none"}, {"element_id": "gt_0017", "element_type": "ResponseSlot", "parent_id": "gt_0013", "reading_order": 17, "bbox": [269.5182, 721.526, 379.2534, 748.8015], "text": null, "content_format": "none"}, {"element_id": "gt_0018", "element_type": "Question", "parent_id": "gt_0008", "reading_order": 18, "bbox": [141.8829, 762.646, 931.7446, 828.2692], "text": "3. 用自己的活赞美一下海滨的夏夜（3分） $$ \\underline{\\quad\\quad\\quad\\quad} $$", "content_format": "mixed_latex"}, {"element_id": "gt_0019", "element_type": "ResponseSlot", "parent_id": "gt_0018", "reading_order": 19, "bbox": [186.6112, 781.7116, 930.0084, 831.8977], "text": null, "content_format": "none"}, {"element_id": "gt_0020", "element_type": "Section", "parent_id": "gt_0000", "reading_order": 20, "bbox": [103.6794, 837.595, 937.538, 946.4798], "text": null, "content_format": "none"}, {"element_id": "gt_0021", "element_type": "Instruction", "parent_id": "gt_0020", "reading_order": 21, "bbox": [111.0947, 841.4431, 352.9983, 866.3975], "text": "八、真情抒写。(30分)", "content_format": "plain_text"}, {"element_id": "gt_0022", "element_type": "Question", "parent_id": "gt_0020", "reading_order": 22, "bbox": [114.1511, 860.9066, 934.0888, 943.0158], "text": "写一篇游记，要按照游览的顺序写一个地方，并把游览的过程写清楚。题目自拟，350字左右。", "content_format": "plain_text"}]}
